{"title":"The New Monetary Economics is underway, legislation allowing","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920184410/0/marginalrevolution~The-New-Monetary-Economics-is-underway-legislation-allowing.html","date":1749843105000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Walmart &amp; Amazon are looking into issuing their own stablecoins—cutting out banks, cards, and slow settlement. If laws like the Genius Act clear, we might be on the cusp of merchant-issued money. Are you ready for a world where checkout includes “Pay with WalmartCoin/AmazonCoin”?</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/thestablecon/status/1933547943920861690\" target=\"_blank\">the tweet</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/finance/banking/walmart-amazon-stablecoin-07de2fdd\" target=\"_blank\">the WSJ article</a>. Here is my podcast with Alex on the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.mercatus.org/marginal-revolution-podcast/new-monetary-economics\">new monetary economics</a>. Note the tagline “What if the most radical ideas about money weren’t wrong—just early?”</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-new-monetary-economics-is-underway-legislation-allowing.html\">The New Monetary Economics is underway, legislation allowing</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920184410/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920184410/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920184410/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https